        <summary>
          <para>Represents reference profile of application. Reference profiles are the ones used during the last profile-guided dexopt. If the last dexopt wasn't profile-guided, then these profiles were not used. Can be used as an input to getAppBytesByDataType(int) to get the size of files of this type.</para>
